                                        {
                                            "no": 1,
                                            "type": "INVOICE",
                                            "note": "IMPORTANT INFORMATION\n\nOrlando Airport Terminal Change\n\nVirgin Atlantic is scheduled to move terminals at Orlando International Airport in June 2026.\n\nPlease ensure you check your arrival and departure terminal details via Virgin Atlantic Manage My Booking prior to travel, as this will confirm the correct terminal for your flight.\n\nTerminal A (A-Side)\nOnce you exit the tram into the main terminal, please follow signs to Level 1, A-Side, and check in with your Virgin Atlantic Holidays representative located by the Hertz desk.\n\nTerminal C\nAfter clearing Customs, please check in with your Virgin Atlantic Holidays representative located on Level 6.  Once checked in to collect your car please follow the signs to the car rental pick-up.\n\nDeposit:\nCredit Card: An authorisation amount of up to $200 will be added\nDebit Card:  An authorisation amount of up to $500 will be added. (Debit cards can only be used with car classes A-F)",
                                            "systemGenerated": true,
                                            "noteId": 0
