                    "description": "Special Assistance Bookings with Car Hire",
                    "note": "Please note - Insurance is not included with adapted vehicles –\nPlease contact the Special Assistance Team on 0344 557 3998 or e-mail \nspecial.assistance@virginholidays.com for further information.",
