                    "modified": false,
                    "noteId": 22667,
                    "title": "Airline - VS",
                    "compulsory": true
                },
                {
                    "no": 6,
                    "code": "USA ESTA NEW - EXTENDED TO 2035",
                    "description": "USA ESTA NEW -  EXTENDED TO 2035",
                    "note": "USA ESTA REQUIREMENTS FOR USA INCLUDING DURING TRANSIT-\n\nBritish Citizens must hold an electronic passport with an integrated chip, ESTA’s \nare valid for 2 years so we recommend you obtain one as soon as possible and \nno later than 72 hours before your flight is schedule to depart.\n\nU.S. Customs and Border Protection have advised that changes in ESTA \napplication processing mean real-time (on the day) approvals will no longer be \navailable.\n\nESTA's are for stays in the USA for up to 90 days, or for transiting through.\nVisit - https://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/esta for more information and to purchase your \nESTA. On occasion, depending on your prior travel history you may not be \neligible for an ESTA and will need to apply for a visa, \nplease visit https://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/esta for more information.",
                    "dateModified": "2024-01-04T14:28:59",
                    "external": true,
                    "internal": true,
                    "priority": "H",
                    "itemInfo": [
                        "CAR 1",
                        "HTL 1",
                        "GEN 2",
                        "FLT 1"
                    ],
                    "rules": [],
                    "advised": true,
                    "advisedTime": "2025-02-05T17:58:35",
                    "modified": false,
                    "noteId": 23606,
                    "title": "Country - US",
                    "compulsory": true
                },
                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "code": "FCDO Advice 1st March 2023 onwards",
                    "description": "FCDO Advice 1st March 2023 onwards",
                    "note": "Please check the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office for the\n latest information on safety and security, local laws, latest travel information.\n Please also ensure you have familiarised yourself and made relevant \narrangements based on the information on passport, entry requirements and \nvisa requirements on the Gov.UK site.\n\nDo check regularly as the advice can change. As you’d expect, due to COVID-19\nyour travel experience may be different to what you might be used to so \nplease familiarise yourself with the changes that may have been put in place \nfor your stay.",
                    "dateModified": "2024-03-29T16:35:51",
                    "external": true,
                    "internal": true,
