                    "note": "When booking Car Hire via Virgin Atlantic Holidays, please note that additional \nin-resort charges may apply, such as parking fees.\n\nPlease refer to either our website or the hotel’s website directly to confirm \nwhether any additional charges apply during your holiday.",
